 id=\"systemStatus\">System nominal</div>\n</header>\n<div class=\"layout\">\n<aside class=\"sidebar\" aria-label=\"Section navigation\">\n<nav>\n<ul id=\"toc\"></ul>\n</nav>\n</aside>\n<main id=\"content\">\n<section id=\"s1\">\n<h2>1. Introduction</h2>\n<p>This manual describes operational procedures for the Atlas platform. It is intended for engineers, operators, and auditors who require precise guidance.</p>\n<p>All numbered sections must be reviewed in order. Deviations require documented approval from the operations lead.</p>\n<dl>\n<dt>Scope</dt><dd>Core platform operations and maintenance</dd>\n<dt導演</dt><dd>Operations Director</dd>\n<dt>Revision</dt><dd>2025-06-01</dd>\n<dt>Classification</dt><dd>Internal Use</dd>\n</dl>\n<table>\n<caption>Revision history</caption>\n<thead><tr><th>Rev</th><th>Date</th><th>Author</th><th>Notes</th><th>Approved</th><th>Pages</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>1.0</td><td>2025-06-01</td><td>A. Smith</td><td>Initial release</td><td>Yes</td><td>400</td></tr>\n<tr><td>1.1</td><td>2025-07-15</td><td>B. Jones</td><td>Clarified safety</td><td>Yes</td><td>405</td></tr>\n<tr><td>1.2</td><td>2025-08-20</td><td>C. Lee</td><td>Updated commands</td><td>Pending</td><td>410</td></tr>\n<tr><td>1.3</td><td>2025-09-10</td><td>D. Patel</td><td>Appendix added</td><td>Pending</td><td>420</td></tr>\n<tr><td>1.4</td><td>2025-10-01</td><td>E. Kim</td><td>Formatting</td><td>Pending</td><td>430</td></tr>\n<tr><td>1.5</td><td>2025-10-30</td><td>F. Garcia</td><td>Review complete</td><td>Pending</td><td>440</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<pre>atlas intro --read --verbose</pre>\n<div class=\"actions\">\n<button data-action=\"ack\">Acknowledge</button>\n<button class=\"secondary\" data-action=\"print\">Print Section</button>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"s2\">\n<h2>2. Purpose</h2>\n<p>The Atlas platform centralizes telemetry, workflow orchestration, and compliance reporting. This manual ensures consistent execution across sites.</p>\n<p>Readers shou